{"availability":"available","full":"FlorianLoyns/clinical-reasoning-trainer","name":"clinical-reasoning-trainer","description":"Interaktiver Clinical-Reasoning-Trainer für die Pflegeausbildung – Fallanalyse, Pflegeplanung, eine HTML-Datei. Als PWA auf iPhone & Android installierbar, offline nutzbar.","category":"Education","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-02-21T09:09:14Z","updated":"2026-10-05T19:19:43Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["clinical-reasoning","education","german","html","mobile-first","nursing-education","offline-first","pflege","pflegeausbildung","progressive-web-app","pwa","vanilla-js"],"demo":"https://florianloyns.github.io/clinical-reasoning-trainer/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:29.009Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:29.009Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:29.009Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:23:12.999Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-07T20:13:43.287Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-09T22:04:59.109Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-13T07:35:03.634Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T21:46:29.009Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Klinisches Urteilen in der Pflege – interaktiv üben","Klicken Sie hier zum Ausprobieren: index.html","Ein interaktives Lernwerkzeug für die generalistische Pflegeausbildung. Der Trainer führt Lernende Schritt für Schritt durch klinisches Pflegedenken – von der Situationserfassung über Pflegediagnose und Maßnahmenplanung bis zur Evaluation. Alles in einer einzigen HTML-Datei, ohne Installation, offline nutzbar."],"features":["Lernmodus – mit Orientierungshinweisen, die erklären, was im jeweiligen Schritt trainiert wird und warum","Prüfungsmodus – ohne Hinweise, direkt wie eine Lernerfolgskontrolle","Falsche Antworten werden nach Fehlerart eingeordnet (komplett daneben, teilweise richtig, überambitioniert) – jede Rückmeldung endet mit einem konkreten Tipp","Richtige Antworten erklären, warum sie richtig sind, nicht nur, dass sie es sind","Teilerfolge und nachvollziehbare Fehler werden ausdrücklich anerkannt"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/FlorianLoyns/clinical-reasoning-trainer/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"73f1bb485fd21f6f5d6bf83f972ce7404a6c156c7577b99e44c9ef669abf7692","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:13.134Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:29.115Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Klinisches Urteilen in der Pflege – interaktiv üben","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/FlorianLoyns/clinical-reasoning-trainer/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"73f1bb485fd21f6f5d6bf83f972ce7404a6c156c7577b99e44c9ef669abf7692","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/FlorianLoyns/clinical-reasoning-trainer/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:29.115Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-05T19:19:43Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/FlorianLoyns/clinical-reasoning-trainer/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:29.116Z","hash":"73f1bb485fd21f6f5d6bf83f972ce7404a6c156c7577b99e44c9ef669abf7692","originalBytes":9911,"storedBytes":9911,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:29.009Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://florianloyns.github.io/clinical-reasoning-trainer/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-13T00:06:26.990Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-13T00:06:26.990Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-13T00:06:26.990Z","target":"https://florianloyns.com/clinical-reasoning-trainer/","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-20T00:06:26.990Z"},"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-13T00:06:26.990Z","previewCheck":{"url":"https://florianloyns.github.io/clinical-reasoning-trainer/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-13T00:06:26.990Z","consecutiveFailures":0,"status":"captured","reason":null,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-20T00:06:26.990Z"},"screenshots":[{"src":"previews/f38f1fc8c603b575fceb8e72.j